@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@examId = 5
@questionId = 15

### Listar preguntas (esperado 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/

### Detalle de pregunta (esperado 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{questionId}}/

### Crear pregunta (esperado 201)
# @name createQuestion
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exam": {{examId}},
  "statement": "What is an HTTP status code?",
  "score": 2,
  "choices": [
    {"text": "A code indicating the result of an HTTP request", "is_correct": true},
    {"text": "A programming language", "is_correct": false},
    {"text": "A database type", "is_correct": false}
  ]
}

### Modificar parcialmente (esperado 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{createQuestion.response.body.id}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statement": "What is an HTTP response status code?"
}

### Eliminar pregunta (esperado 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{createQuestion.response.body.id}}/

### Comprobar eliminación (esperado 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{createQuestion.response.body.id}}/

# ===== Paso 9: errores provocados a propósito =====

### Error 1: campo obligatorio ausente (esperado 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exam": {{examId}},
  "score": 1,
  "choices": [
    {"text": "Choice A", "is_correct": true},
    {"text": "Choice B", "is_correct": false}
  ]
}

### Error 2: tipo incorrecto (esperado 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exam": "abc",
  "statement": "Valid statement",
  "score": 2,
  "choices": [
    {"text": "Choice A", "is_correct": true},
    {"text": "Choice B", "is_correct": false},
    {"text": "Choice C", "is_correct": false}
  ]
}

### Error 3: validación de la opción correcta (esperado 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exam": {{examId}},
  "statement": "Question with two correct choices",
  "score": 2,
  "choices": [
    {"text": "Choice A", "is_correct": true},
    {"text": "Choice B", "is_correct": true},
    {"text": "Choice C", "is_correct": false}
  ]
}